  "description": "Find the n-th positive integer that does not contain the digit 9 by treating numbers as base-9 digits.",
  "target": 10,
  "pseudocode": "function remove9(n) {\n  let res = '';\n  while (n > 0) {\n    res = (n % 9) + res;\n    n = Math.floor(n / 9);\n  }\n  return parseInt(res);\n}",
